# Objects.yaml
# Physical operational topology registry for the Belize-based sargassum interception and processing system.
# Authority: defines high-value physical project objects and their admissible variable attachments.
# Boundary: does not redefine variables, equations, operators, formats, subsystem mechanics, or state machines.
